als" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 24 Thoughts on Game 6 of the 2021 NBA Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="4/4" data-section="game-6:-bucks-105,-suns-98" data-section-pos="8/16" data-content="24 Thoughts on Game 6 of The Finals" data-content-id="584222" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-locker-room-celebration.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-locker-room-celebration.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-locker-room-celebration.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="24 Thoughts on Game 6 of the 2021 NBA Finals" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/news/24-thoughts-on-game-6-of-2021-nba-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 24 Thoughts on Game 6 of the 2021 NBA Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="4/4" data-section="game-6:-bucks-105,-suns-98" data-section-pos="8/16" data-content="24 Thoughts on Game 6 of The Finals" data-content-id="584222" data-premium="false"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">24 Thoughts on Game 6 of The Finals</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Instant observations and real-time tweets from Game 6 of The Finals as it happened in Milwaukee on Tuesday night.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/24-thoughts-on-game-6-of-2021-nba-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 24 Thoughts on Game 6 of the 2021 NBA Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="4/4" data-section="game-6:-bucks-105,-suns-98" data-section-pos="8/16" data-content="24 Thoughts on Game 6 of The Finals" data-content-id="584222" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="NewsHero_newsBase__zawGu" data-has-siderail="true" template="default"><div class="MaxWidthContainer_mwc__ChCs_ NewsHero_newsContainer__ZdFPX" data-padding="false" data-ad-slot="false" data-max-width="xl"><h2 class="Text_text__6vd08 BlockTitle_base__2GNiO NewsHero_blockTitle__wO_lF" data-small="false" data-hide-small-border="false"><p class="NewsHero_title__SoOe3">GAME 5: BUCKS 123, SUNS 119</p></h2><div class="NewsHero_hero__eVhH3"><div class="NewsHero_heroInner__0r0eZ"><a href="/game/mil-vs-phx-0042000405" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 HeroArticleTile_link___eTGD" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Bucks overcome slow start, move 1 win from title" data-sponser="false" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="1/4" data-section="game-5:-bucks-123,-suns-119" data-section-pos="9/16" data-content="Bucks overcome slow start, move 1 win from title" data-content-id="583999" data-premium="false"><article class="HeroArticleTile_article__0AU2T"><div class="HeroArticleTile_videoContent__bPYIJ"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD HeroArticleTile_videoThumb__FLAyG" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-oop.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-oop.jpg?w=784&amp;h=441 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-oop.jpg?w=1568&amp;h=882 2x" alt="Bucks overcome slow start, move 1 win from title" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_summary___I_yz"><div class="HeroArticleTile_summaryInner__nRi3g"><header data-type="headline"><h3 class="Text_text__6vd08 HeroArticleTile_title__Jxrmr"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Bucks overcome slow start, move 1 win from title</span></h3><p class="Text_text__6vd08 HeroArticleTile_subtitle__doqz4"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Three down, one to go. Jrue Holiday&#x27;s clutch steal and alley-oop pass to Giannis Antetokounmpo ends Phoenix&#x27;s late rally and seals Milwaukee&#x27;s wild victory in Game 5.</span></p></header></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_timestampBlock__frqdc"><span class="HeroArticleTile_timestamp__Z0i6n">July 21, 2021</span></div></div></article></a></div><div class="NewsHero_aside__OnlCW"><ul class="RelatedArticleBlock_rab__4xdtb"><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/suns-bucks-game-5-analysis-jrue-holidays-two-way-masterpiece-lifts-bucks-to-championship-precipice" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Jrue Holiday&#x27;s two-way masterpiece lifts Bucks to championship precipice" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-