 it with an incredible defensive play.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/suns-bucks-game-5-analysis-jrue-holidays-two-way-masterpiece-lifts-bucks-to-championship-precipice" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Jrue Holiday&#x27;s two-way masterpiece lifts Bucks to championship precipice" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-5:-bucks-123,-suns-119" data-section-pos="9/16" data-content="Holiday&#x27;s two-way masterpiece puts Bucks on precipice" data-content-id="583402" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-bucks-123-suns-119-8enof1" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-5:-bucks-123,-suns-119" data-section-pos="9/16" data-content="Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" data-content-id="583338" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2021 NBA Playoffs" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/GettyImages-1234036727-scaled-e1626591092668.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/GettyImages-1234036727-scaled-e1626591092668.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/GettyImages-1234036727-scaled-e1626591092668.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/><div class="VideoThumbnail_base__yet4f"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="PlayVideoIcon_icon__vHhLK PlayVideoIcon_triangle__OB0w4" data-no-icon="true" role="presentation" style="height:24px;width:24px"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="m10.15 7.35-4.9 3.15V4.2z"></path></svg><span class="VideoThumbnail_runtime__oJK3B">04:04</span></div></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-bucks-123-suns-119-8enof1" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-5:-bucks-123,-suns-119" data-section-pos="9/16" data-content="Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" data-content-id="583338" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2021 NBA Playoffs" data-live-vod="vod"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Led by Giannis Antetokounmpo&#x27;s 32 points and Khris Middleton&#x27;s 29, the Bucks beat the Suns to take a 3-2 lead back to Milwaukee.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-bucks-123-suns-119-8enof1" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-5:-bucks-123,-suns-119" data-section-pos="9/16" data-content="Game Recap: Bucks 123, Suns 119" data-content-id="583338" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2021 NBA Playoffs" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/2021-finals-game-5-the-wrap" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for The Wrap: Full coverage from Game 5 of the 2021 NBA Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="4/4" data-section="game-5:-bucks-123,-suns-119" data-section-pos="9/16" data-content="The Wrap: Complete coverage of Game 5" data-content-id="582922" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-dunk-071721.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-dunk-071721.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-dunk-071721.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="The Wrap: Full coverage from Game 5 of the 2021 NBA Finals" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTil