6vd08 BlockTitle_base__2GNiO NewsHero_blockTitle__wO_lF" data-small="false" data-hide-small-border="false"><p class="NewsHero_title__SoOe3">GAME 4: BUCKS 109, SUNS 103</p></h2><div class="NewsHero_hero__eVhH3"><div class="NewsHero_heroInner__0r0eZ"><a href="/game/phx-vs-mil-0042000404" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 HeroArticleTile_link___eTGD" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Bucks fend off Booker, Suns to pull even" data-sponser="false" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="1/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Bucks fend off Booker, Suns to pull even" data-content-id="581968" data-premium="false"><article class="HeroArticleTile_article__0AU2T"><div class="HeroArticleTile_videoContent__bPYIJ"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD HeroArticleTile_videoThumb__FLAyG" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-emotion-071421.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-emotion-071421.jpg?w=784&amp;h=441 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-emotion-071421.jpg?w=1568&amp;h=882 2x" alt="Bucks fend off Booker, Suns to pull even" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_summary___I_yz"><div class="HeroArticleTile_summaryInner__nRi3g"><header data-type="headline"><h3 class="Text_text__6vd08 HeroArticleTile_title__Jxrmr"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Bucks fend off Booker, Suns to pull even</span></h3><p class="Text_text__6vd08 HeroArticleTile_subtitle__doqz4"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Khris Middleton scores 40 and Giannis Antetokounmpo has a game-saving block as Milwaukee tops Phoenix in Game 4 to spoil Devin Booker&#x27;s 42-point effort and turn The Finals into a best of 3.
 </span></p></header></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_timestampBlock__frqdc"><span class="HeroArticleTile_timestamp__Z0i6n">July 15, 2021</span></div></div></article></a></div><div class="NewsHero_aside__OnlCW"><ul class="RelatedArticleBlock_rab__4xdtb"><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/giannis-antetokounmpos-clutch-block-helps-bucks-even-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Giannis Antetokounmpo&#x27;s clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Giannis&#x27; clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" data-content-id="582192" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-block-game-4.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-block-game-4.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/giannis-block-game-4.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="Giannis Antetokounmpo&#x27;s clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/news/giannis-antetokounmpos-clutch-block-helps-bucks-even-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Giannis Antetokounmpo&#x27;s clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Giannis&#x27; clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" data-content-id="582192" data-premium="false"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Giannis&#x27; clutch block helps Bucks even Finals</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Should Milwaukee go on to win The Finals, Antetokounmpo’s game-saving block in Game 4 will be remembered as one of the greatest in NBA history.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/giannis-antetokounmpos-clutch-block-helps-bucks-even-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Giannis Antetokounmpo&#x27;s clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Giannis&#x27; clutch block helps Bucks even Finals" data-content-id="582192" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-bucks-109-suns-103-d5h3my" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" data-content-id="582212" data-premium="false" data-franchise="2 Minute Game Recap" data-cat-type="2021 NBA Finals" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/PHX_MIL_0714.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/PHX_MIL_0714.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2021/07/PHX_MIL_0714.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/><div class="VideoThumbnail_base__yet4f"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="PlayVideoIcon_icon__vHhLK PlayVideoIcon_triangle__OB0w4" data-no-icon="true" role="presentation" style="height:24px;width:24px"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="m10.15 7.35-4.9 3.15V4.2z"></path></svg><span class="VideoThumbnail_runtime__oJK3B">03:17</span></div></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-bucks-109-suns-103-d5h3my" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" data-content-id="582212" data-premium="false" data-franchise="2 Minute Game Recap" data-cat-type="2021 NBA Finals" data-live-vod="vod"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Led by Khris Middletons 40 points (24 in the 2nd half), six rebounds and four assists, the Bucks defeated the Suns, 109-103, in Game 4. Giannis Antetokounmpo added 26 points, 14 rebounds and eight assists for the Bucks in the victory, while Devin Booker tallied a game-high 42 points for the Suns. This best-of-seven series is now tied, 2-2, with Game 5 taking place on Saturday, July 17 at 9:00 p.m. ET</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-bucks-109-suns-103-d5h3my" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-4:-bucks-109,-suns-103" data-section-pos="10/16" data-content="Game Recap: Bucks 109, Suns 103" data-content-id="582212" data-premium="false" data-franchise="2 Minute Game Recap" data-cat-type="2021 NBA Finals" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/the-wrap-full-coverage-from-game-4-of-the-2021-nba-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for The Wrap: Full coverage 